0008 - CLI & feature knobs
==========================

The user-facing switches: tailscale up / set behaviour on a platform with no desktop session, and the env knobs that gate Android-only features.

concern   : cli-and-feature-knobs
files     : 3
upstream  : squashed android patch d6a7411 (tailscale v1.98.5 -> v1.98.8), 2026-07-13
apply     : git apply patches/0008-cli-and-feature-knobs.patch

